msgid ""
"Use Spicy Lyrics' catalogue for character-synced words when it has them. "
"Spotify usually times whole lines."
msgstr ""
"Używa katalogu Spicy Lyrics do słów zsynchronizowanych co znak, gdy je ma. "
"Spotify zwykle synchronizuje całe wersy."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1275
